---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Downloader from '../components/Downloader.astro';
import AdPlaceholder from '../components/AdPlaceholder.astro';

const homepageJsonLd = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "WebSite",
      "name": "YouPiper",
      "url": "https://youpiper.com/"
    },
    {
      "@type": "WebApplication",
      "name": "YouPiper YouTube Video Downloader",
      "url": "https://youpiper.com/",
      "applicationCategory": "MultimediaApplication",
      "operatingSystem": "All",
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "price": "0",
        "priceCurrency": "USD"
      },
      "description": "Download YouTube videos online in MP4, HD and 4K formats with our fast, simple YouTube video downloader. Free to use and easy on any device."
    }
  ]
};
---

<Layout
  title="YouTube Video Download – Free Online MP4 Downloader"
  description="Download YouTube videos online in MP4, HD and 4K formats with our fast, simple YouTube video downloader. Free to use and easy on any device."
  canonicalUrl="https://youpiper.com/"
  ogTitle="YouTube Video Download – Free Online MP4 Downloader"
  ogDescription="Download YouTube videos online in MP4, HD and 4K formats with a fast and simple downloader."
  twitterTitle="YouTube Video Download – Free Online MP4 Downloader"
  twitterDescription="Download YouTube videos online in MP4, HD and 4K formats with a fast and simple downloader."
  ogImage="https://youpiper.com/og-image.png"
  jsonLd={homepageJsonLd}
>
  <div class="homepage-wrapper">
    <!-- Hero & Downloader (Above the fold) -->
    <section class="downloader-section">
      <Downloader
        title="YouTube Video Download"
        tagline="Download YouTube videos online in MP4, HD and 4K quality with a fast, simple and easy-to-use video downloader."
        headingLevel="h1"
      />
    </section>

    <!-- Top Advertisement Placeholder -->
    <AdPlaceholder slotLocation="top-banner" />

    <!-- Long-form Helpful SEO Content Section (800-1200 words) -->
    <article class="seo-article">
      <section class="seo-block">
        <h2>YouTube Video Download Online</h2>
        <p>
          Finding a fast, reliable web tool to perform a <strong>youtube video download online</strong> allows you to save video content directly through your internet browser without installing bulky third-party software. Whether you need to save tutorials, music videos, educational lectures, or entertainment content for offline viewing during travel, an online downloader provides instant access across all modern devices. By simply copying and pasting a video link into the web interface, the system analyzes available streams and prepares high-quality media files for immediate saving. Online video downloading eliminates compatibility hurdles, complex software configuration, and account registrations, making it the most convenient option for everyday users.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="seo-block">
        <h2>YouTube Video Download in MP4</h2>
        <p>
          Choosing a <strong>youtube video download mp4</strong> format guarantees that your saved video plays seamlessly across almost any platform, including Windows PCs, macOS, iOS, Android, smart TVs, and media players. MP4 (MPEG-4 Part 14) is the global standard container for digital video because it delivers an exceptional balance of sharp visual quality and compact file size. When you process a request to convert a <strong>youtube video download into mp4</strong>, YouPiper automatically merges separate video and audio streams into a single, ready-to-play file. If you prefer an audio-only <strong>youtube video download mp3</strong> track for podcasts or music playlists, you can extract audio files using our dedicated <a href="/youtube-mp3">YouTube MP3 converter</a>. For full video downloads, our <a href="/youtube-mp4">YouTube MP4 downloader</a> handles high-speed <strong>youtube video download mp4 convert</strong> tasks effortlessly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="seo-block">
        <h2>YouTube Video Download in HD and 1080p</h2>
        <p>
          High-definition media provides crisp clarity, vibrant colors, and sharp details, making <strong>youtube video download hd</strong> options essential for widescreen displays and professional viewing. YouPiper supports high-resolution downloads up to <strong>youtube video download 1080p</strong> Full HD quality, as well as 720p HD, 480p, and standard 360p options. Because YouTube splits high-definition video and high-fidelity audio into separate streams during playback, standard download methods often yield video files without sound. YouPiper resolves this by fetching both streams and stitching them together on-the-fly, producing a full HD MP4 file with clear stereo audio. Resolution options depend on the maximum quality provided by the creator in the original source video upload. To learn more about high-definition options, visit our dedicated <a href="/youtube-video-downloader">YouTube HD downloader</a> page.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="seo-block">
        <h2>YouTube Video Download in 4K</h2>
        <p>
          For modern 4K monitors, Ultra HD televisions, and high-end displays, opting for a <strong>youtube video download 4k</strong> resolution preserves four times the visual detail of standard 1080p HD. 4K video downloads capture subtle textures, intense color depths, and extreme clarity for cinematic content, nature documentaries, and high-framerate media. When source videos are uploaded in 2160p resolution, YouPiper detects these Ultra HD streams and allows you to perform a <strong>youtube video download 4k free</strong> of charge. 4K availability always depends on the source video's original resolution and supported processing on your playback device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="seo-block">
        <h2>Free YouTube Video Download</h2>
        <p>
          Everyone should have access to a straightforward, <strong>free youtube video download</strong> service without encountering hidden paywalls, intrusive subscription prompts, or artificial download caps. YouPiper is committed to providing a completely <strong>youtube video download free</strong> experience where every core feature—including HD downloads, MP4 conversions, and MP3 audio extraction—is fully accessible without payment or user registration. We do not restrict file sizes or force users to sign up for premium tiers. For power users seeking desktop-speed performance without server queues, we also offer the optional <a href="/helper">YouPiper Helper</a> companion app at zero cost.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="seo-block">
        <h2>Download YouTube Videos on Mobile</h2>
        <p>
          In today's mobile-first world, performing a video download on smartphone devices like iPhones, iPads, and Android phones is essential. You do not need to search for a dedicated <strong>youtube video download app</strong> or install third-party application packages. Web-based downloading works directly within your mobile browser, such as Safari on iOS or Chrome on Android. When completing a <strong>youtube video download iphone</strong> request, Safari prompts you to save the file straight to your Files app, from where you can easily save the video directly to your camera roll or save your <strong>youtube video download in gallery</strong> storage. Avoiding unnecessary mobile app downloads keeps your phone secure and frees up valuable storage space.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="seo-block">
        <h2>YouTube Video Download Without Watermark</h2>
        <p>
          Users frequently search for a <strong>youtube video download without watermark</strong> tool to ensure clean media playback. It is important to understand how watermarks work: YouPiper processes and delivers the exact media stream provided by the creator. Downloading a video through YouPiper does not insert any new watermarks, logos, or branding onto your media. However, if the original content creator embedded a watermark, logo, or channel overlay into the raw video file before uploading it to YouTube, downloading the video will not erase that embedded graphic. To obtain completely watermark-free media, always download or license original source files directly from the content owner when you hold authorization.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="seo-block">
        <h2>How to Download a YouTube Video</h2>
        <p>
          Saving online videos with YouPiper is fast and intuitive. Follow these simple steps to complete your download:
        </p>
        <ol class="seo-steps">
          <li><strong>Copy the Video Link:</strong> Open YouTube in your app or browser, navigate to the video you are authorized to download, and copy the full <strong>youtube video download link</strong> from your browser address bar or share menu.</li>
          <li><strong>Paste the URL:</strong> Return to the YouPiper homepage and paste the link into the URL input field located at the top of the page.</li>
          <li><strong>Analyze the Video:</strong> Click the <strong>Analyze video</strong> button. YouPiper inspects the URL and retrieves all available video resolutions and audio formats.</li>
          <li><strong>Choose Your Format:</strong> Review the format list, which displays available resolutions (1080p, 720p, 480p, 360p MP4) and MP3 audio options.</li>
          <li><strong>Start Download:</strong> Click the <strong>Download</strong> button next to your desired quality. YouPiper processes the file and delivers it directly to your browser's Downloads folder.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="seo-block">
        <h2>Why Use an Online YouTube Video Downloader?</h2>
        <p>
          Using a browser-based online downloader offers major advantages over heavy desktop software and browser extensions. Web tools require zero installation, operating safely inside your browser's isolated sandbox environment. They work identically across macOS, Windows, Linux, iOS, and Android without platform compatibility conflicts. Furthermore, online tools protect your privacy because no account creation or personal data submission is required. With YouPiper, you enjoy instant media access while maintaining complete control over your local device storage.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="seo-block">
        <h2>A Simple YouTube Downloader</h2>
        <p>
          At YouPiper, our goal is to deliver a minimal, lightning-fast, and effortless video downloading experience. By focusing on clean interface design, accurate format detection, and transparent downloading options, we eliminate clutter and unnecessary steps. Whether you need a high-definition 1080p MP4 file for offline presentation or an MP3 audio track for your music library, YouPiper provides a smooth, reliable solution every time.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>

    <!-- Mid Content Advertisement Placeholder -->
    <AdPlaceholder slotLocation="mid-banner" />

    <!-- FAQ Section -->
    <section class="content-section" id="faq">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details class="faq-item" open>
          <summary class="faq-question"><h3>Can I download YouTube videos online?</h3></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Yes. YouPiper allows you to download YouTube videos directly online in your web browser without installing any software or registering an account.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question"><h3>Can I download YouTube videos as MP4?</h3></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Yes. YouPiper converts and saves YouTube videos in the widely supported MP4 format with audio merged in for universal compatibility.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question"><h3>Can I download YouTube videos in HD or 4K?</h3></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Yes. YouPiper supports high-definition downloads in 1080p Full HD and 720p HD, as well as 4K Ultra HD downloads depending on the quality of the original source video uploaded by the creator.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question"><h3>Can I use the YouTube video downloader on my phone?</h3></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Yes. YouPiper works directly in mobile browsers on iOS (iPhone/iPad) and Android, allowing you to download videos to your device without installing a separate mobile application.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question"><h3>Is the YouTube video downloader free?</h3></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            Yes. YouPiper is 100% free to use online with no hidden fees, paid subscriptions, or required account registration.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-question"><h3>Do I need to install anything?</h3></summary>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            No. YouPiper works entirely in your browser with nothing installed. YouPiper Helper is an optional add-on that makes downloads faster, but you never need it to download a video. <a href="/helper">Learn more about YouPiper Helper</a>.
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Legal & Responsible Use Notice -->
    <section class="legal-notice-box">
      <p>
        <strong>Responsible Use Notice:</strong> Only download videos when you have the necessary rights or permission to do so, or when downloading is otherwise permitted by the applicable service and law. YouPiper is intended for personal archiving and educational use.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .homepage-wrapper {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 40px 24px;
  }

  .downloader-section {
    padding: 32px 0 16px;
  }

  .content-section {
    margin: 64px 0;
  }

  .section-heading {
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
  }

  /* SEO Content Styling */
  .seo-article {
    margin: 48px 0;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-body);
  }

  .seo-block {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .seo-article h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.3px;
  }

  .seo-article p {
    font-size: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    color: var(--color-body);
  }

  .seo-article a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .seo-article a:hover {
    color: var(--color-primary-active);
  }

  .seo-steps {
    margin: 16px 0 24px 24px;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .seo-steps li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    padding-left: 6px;
  }

  /* FAQ List */
  .faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 840px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .faq-item {
    background-color: var(--color-canvas);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--rounded-md);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
  }

  .faq-question {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    outline: none;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .faq-question h3 {
    display: inline;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .faq-answer {
    margin-top: 12px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .faq-answer a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 2px;
  }

  /* Legal Notice Box */
  .legal-notice-box {
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    background-color: var(--color-surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--rounded-sm);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
